@base = http://127.0.0.1:19092

### Actual schema of the MAIN connection
GET {{base}}/api/datasources/current?scope=MAIN

### Actual schema of the SANDBOX connection
GET {{base}}/api/datasources/current?scope=SANDBOX

### Create in MAIN; save response ID for following requests
POST {{base}}/api/orders?scope=MAIN
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BOOK-001","quantity":1}

> {% client.global.set("mainOrderId", response.body.id); %}

### Read MAIN order: 200
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{mainOrderId}}?scope=MAIN

### Same ID in SANDBOX: expected 404
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{mainOrderId}}?scope=SANDBOX

### Paged query: OrderPageQO -> OrderPageQuery -> PageDTO -> PageVO
GET {{base}}/api/orders?scope=MAIN&sku=BOOK-001&status=CREATED&page=1&size=10

### Create in SANDBOX
POST {{base}}/api/orders?scope=SANDBOX
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"BOOK-001","quantity":2}

> {% client.global.set("sandboxOrderId", response.body.id); %}

### Confirm only SANDBOX order
POST {{base}}/api/orders/{{sandboxOrderId}}/confirm?scope=SANDBOX

### Unknown scope: expected 400; never silently route to MAIN
GET {{base}}/api/orders?scope=public
